REM QBasic interpreter oracle: run the program directly (no compile step).
REM /RUN loads and runs T.BAS, which writes RESULT.TXT itself and ends with
REM SYSTEM, returning to DOS so the harness can finish. The oracle toolchain
REM is mounted as D:; the current drive is C: (the test directory).
D:\QBASIC.EXE /RUN T.BAS
